                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The simultaneous firing of a number of missiles or bullets; the projectiles so fired."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccee40ab-6509-4cc9-8781-3b6b4a493e48",
                                                "sense_id": "6ea63b92-44d3-361c-8d71-cf06d0a65941",
                                                "text": "Fiery darts in flaming volies flew."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81e13634-2561-4f2d-bc4f-5be566f7cee2",
                                                "sense_id": "6ea63b92-44d3-361c-8d71-cf06d0a65941",
                                                "text": "Each volley tells that thousands cease to breathe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d8b876d-9ab4-46ce-b6d8-fbf082e0ed95",
                                                "sense_id": "6ea63b92-44d3-361c-8d71-cf06d0a65941",
                                                "text": "It was by his order the shattered leading company flung itself into the houses when the Sin Verguenza were met by an enfilading volley as they reeled into the calle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7525d64-aea7-326a-9e97-a0daf7359825",
                                        "entry_id": "ca5a61ef-13dc-3334-a86f-4ea24e7b4944",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A burst or emission of many things at once."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bcafc32-674b-4208-af0c-c3085a82452b",
                                                "sense_id": "e7525d64-aea7-326a-9e97-a0daf7359825",
                                                "text": "a volley of words"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af959cfd-320d-4e7c-96e9-35f01542eb1b",
                                                "sense_id": "e7525d64-aea7-326a-9e97-a0daf7359825",
                                                "text": "When we do speak at volley"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac4ab3e9-b790-44e4-8da4-0f3ba4b907d4",
                                                "sense_id": "e7525d64-aea7-326a-9e97-a0daf7359825",
                                                "text": "A whole volley of furious criticism was poured on the author [Alexander Pope] by those enemies whom his contempt had created, and his honest pride had justly disdained to propitiate."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8c3e24a-fd9c-32ba-864b-72840dbf119c",
                                        "entry_id": "ca5a61ef-13dc-3334-a86f-4ea24e7b4944",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The flight of a ball just before it bounces."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "41f5b1c6-7123-32ad-9791-4ef01ff7aa6f",
                                        "entry_id": "ca5a61ef-13dc-3334-a86f-4ea24e7b4944",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A shot in which the ball is played before it hits the ground."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7a577b1-8a75-4049-a42b-97dbf0ca9b7d",
                                                "sense_id": "41f5b1c6-7123-32ad-9791-4ef01ff7aa6f",
                                                "text": "But there was nothing he could do about Villa's second when Agbonlahor crossed from the left and Bent finished with a precision volley."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e87e0ca3-e5a5-3b63-952b-25f83f806c84",
